                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">近日，浙江省教育厅教研室公布全省中小学“抗疫情”项目学习案例征集结果，我校青年教师生物组杨琼（负责人）、政治组茹奕蓓、地理组徐冲越等精心开发的学习案例《新冠肺炎战“疫”中的口罩危机研究》（特别鸣谢生物学科主任沈初见老师的指导和帮助），获评优秀案例入选本次案例征集。本次案例征集紧扣时政热点，强调基于特定情境、问题的跨学科研究性、探究式学习，共收到全省中小学<SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">836</SPAN>篇递交作品，评选<SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">100</SPAN>篇优秀案例，绍兴地区共有<SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">8</SPAN>篇入选，我校杨琼老师的案例是全市唯一入选的高中段学习案例。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062817064834.png"><BR><BR></P>
