ING: border-box; FONT-SIZE: 15px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; COLOR: rgb(62,215,210); PADDING-BOTTOM: 8px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 8px; PADDING-LEFT: 10px; MARGIN: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 30px; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; overflow-wrap: break-word; transform: rotate(0deg)">
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WHITE-SPACE: normal; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(31,78,121); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">领会精神：育人方式改革</SPAN></STRONG></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WHITE-SPACE: normal; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(31,78,121); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">《国务院办公厅关于新时代推进普通高中育人方式改革的指导意见》（国办发〔2019〕<SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">29</SPAN>号）对于新时期的学校和教师在构建全面培养体系、优化课程实施、创新教学组织管理等方面提出了许多详实的要求，特别在“深化课堂教学改革”中指出：要“积极探索基于情境、问题导向的互动式、启发式、探究式、体验式等课堂教学，注重加强课题研究、项目设计、研究性学习等跨学科综合性教学”；要“提高作业设计质量，精心设计基础性作业，适当增加探究性、实践性、综合性作业”；要“推进信息技术与教育教学深度融合”。</SPAN></P></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WIDTH: 25px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px 5px 5px -30px; DISPLAY: flex; LINE-HEIGHT: 0; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; flex-shrink: 0; pointer-events: none; flex-flow: column"></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION></ARTICLE></SECTION>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062817081270.png"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: left; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">自新冠肺炎疫情爆发以来，口罩成为人们生活的必需品，一“罩”难求成为市场常态。如何正确认识新冠肺炎战“疫”中的口罩危机，提升学生的责任意识和问题解决能力，显得至关重要。当前高中生对口罩紧缺现象有一定的感性认识，但缺乏系统的理性思考。鉴于此，本项目着眼于高中生的责任担当和思维提升，从新冠肺炎疫情期间一“罩”难求的现实情境出发，开展项目学习活动，来引导学生从跨学科角度解读这一现象背后潜藏着的问题真相。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">Since the outbreak of the pneumonia<SPAN> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">caused by COVID-19</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">,masks have become a necessity for people</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">’</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">s li</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">fe</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"> and being hard to get a single mask has been a market normality.It appears vital how the students are able to have a correct understanding of mask crisis during the Anti-Corona Virus war and improve their sense of responsibility as well as ability of problem-solving. At present, high school students have a certain perceptual knowledge of the shortage of masks, but they lack systematic rational thinking.<SPAN> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">Accordingly</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">,<SPAN> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">our</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"> project focuses on the responsibility and thinking of high school students, starting from a realistic situation that is hard to find</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"> masks</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"> during the epidemic, and carrying out project learning activities to guide students to interpret the hidden truth behind this situation from an interdisciplinary perspective.</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"></SPAN> </P><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"></SPAN>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; overflow-wrap: break-word" align=center><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062817083814.png"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><BR><BR></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; overflow-wrap: break-word" align=center><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062817083806.png"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; overflow-wrap: break-word"> </P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">该项目以任务为主线，共设置了四项学习和实践任务，每项学习任务中又根据各阶段所要解决的核心问题、所要达到的学习目标，分别设置了富有学科特色、形式多样化的学习任务，通过多元化的评价确保最终形成了多元化的学习成果：如手绘产业链图、新冠病毒档案、口罩的设计图、生产商访谈报告等。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><BR style='BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 17px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei UI", "Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 37px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial'></P>
    
